{"c":[{"id":"2344b5030265f7ee","sum":"semantic/embed restore torch once from a usable hashed freeze and retry; else say re-run sr-initialize. doctor smoke is report-only. Nightly payload: (date; stockroom shim ensure-env; stockroom ingest && stockroom embed): a failed heal still ingests; failed ingest skips embed.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261020T193116Z-270eb1650c4e7f96","text":"semantic and embed restore torch once from a usable hashed freeze and retry; no freeze, a failed restore, or any other encoder failure says re-run sr-initialize. doctor smoke stays report-only and still names ensure-env when a freeze exists.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261020T205704Z-a2498a1e20047fe3","text":"Nightly cron and launchd payload is (date; stockroom shim ensure-env; stockroom ingest && stockroom embed). A failed heal still ingests; a failed ingest still skips embed.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1046806e8c5186a7","sum":"Issue 147 migration chain (copy, check, swap) is short-lived (~5-6 installs, a month or two), own module, reliable not bulletproof; data-safety holds. DuckDB 2.0.0 (LTS to Oct 2027; 1.5 to Mar 2027): suite passes; new files are v2.0.0+, unreadable before 2.0.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261021T145418Z-a7061b3a1a0c5bbf","text":"Issue 147 storage migration chain (verified copy, session-start check, swap) is short-lived: about 5-6 installs, kept a month or two, then removed. Build it reliable, not bulletproof; data-safety rules still hold. Keep it in its own module.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261021T155046Z-35a2088124b6c3aa","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 (2026-10-21, LTS to Oct 2027; 1.5 to Mar 2027): engine suite passes unchanged (uv --with overlay), vss loads, HNSW still used (EXPLAIN prints 'Hnsw Index Scan', not HNSW_INDEX_SCAN). New files are v2.0.0+ by default; DuckDB before 2.0 cannot read them.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
